<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see hot, sunny weather.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see hot, sunny weather.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Friday were forecast  to see sunny skies, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see sun with isolated showers and highs of 23 to 29  Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see mainly sunny skies with highs of 22 to 30  Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see mainly sunny skies with highs of 24 to 28 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
